---
const linkedin = 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/umair-ahmed-3675261b0/';
---

<section class="section section--filing note-section" aria-labelledby="note-heading">
  <div class="container note-inner">

    <h1 id="note-heading" class="u-headline note-heading" data-reveal>
      Why we're building SuretyOS.
    </h1>

    <div class="note-body" data-reveal data-delay="1">
      <p>
        We spent months sitting with surety producers and agency owners, watching
        the same afternoon repeat itself. A bond request comes in. The same client
        name, the same amount, the same case number gets typed by hand into a bond
        form, a power of attorney, an indemnity agreement, and a court cover sheet.
        One set of facts, four documents, forty-five minutes gone. Then it goes onto
        a renewals tab in a spreadsheet that nobody fully trusts.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every agency had built its own workaround, and every workaround was held
        together by someone's memory. None of them should have had to. The software
        they'd been sold was built for general insurance and bent to fit surety,
        never built for it.
      </p>
      <p>
        SuretyOS is the system we wanted to hand them. One intake, every document
        generated pre-filled, every renewal tracked for the life of the bond.
        Built for court, commercial, and construction bonds specifically, with the
        people who write them every day.
      </p>
      <p class="note-emphasis">
        We're taking on the first 25 founding agencies ourselves. If you write real bond
        volume and you're tired of the retyping, we want to hear exactly how you work.
        You'll have our direct line, and your feedback decides what we build first.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="signature" data-reveal data-delay="2">
      <span class="sig-mark" aria-hidden="true">UA</span>
      <div class="sig-meta">
        <span class="sig-name">Umair Ahmed</span>
        <span class="sig-role">Co-Founder, SuretyOS</span>
      </div>
      <a
        class="sig-linkedin"
        href={linkedin}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="Umair Ahmed on LinkedIn"
      >
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.42v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 110-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 010 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/>
        </svg>
        Connect on LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .note-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .note-heading {
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-8);
  }

  .note-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-5);
  }

  .note-body p {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    max-width: 64ch;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* The ask — the one line that should land hardest. */
  .note-emphasis {
    color: var(--ink) !important;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ── Signature: reads like the close of a letter ── */
  .signature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    margin-top: var(--sp-10);
    padding-top: var(--sp-6);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(14, 39, 68, 0.12);
  }

  .sig-mark {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: white;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .sig-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .sig-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-title);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .sig-role {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
  }

  .sig-linkedin {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(14, 39, 68, 0.18);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: white;
    color: var(--teal);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
  }

  .sig-linkedin:hover {
    border-color: var(--teal);
    color: var(--teal-hover);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .sig-linkedin:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--teal);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .signature {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: var(--sp-3);
    }
    .sig-linkedin {
      margin-left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.6875rem 0.875rem;
    }
  }
</style>
